/span></div><div><p class="text-label-md font-label-md text-on-surface">Terminal v2.4</p><p class="text-xs text-on-surface-variant">Status: Online</p></div></div></div></aside><div class="pl-72"><header class="fixed top-0 left-72 right-0 h-16 bg-background/80 backdrop-blur-xl z-40 px-gutter flex items-center justify-between border-b border-outline-variant/5"><div class="flex items-center gap-4 flex-1"><span class="text-on-surface-variant font-label-md text-label-md uppercase tracking-tighter">SOLVIX BI Terminal</span><div class="h-4 w-[1px] bg-outline-variant/30 mx-2"></div><div class="relative max-w-md w-full group"><span class="material-symbols-outlined absolute left-3 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 text-on-surface-variant text-[20px] group-focus-within:text-primary transition-colors">search</span><input class="w-full bg-surface-container-highest/30 border border-outline-variant/20 rounded-xl py-1.5 pl-10 pr-4 text-sm focus:outline-none focus:border-primary/50 focus:bg-surface-container-highest/50 transition-all text-on-surface" placeholder="Buscar transacciones, SKUs o reportes..." type="text"/></div></div><div class="flex items-center gap-6"><button class="flex items-center justify-center text-on-surface-variant hover:text-primary transition-colors"><span class="material-symbols-outlined">notifications</span></button><div class="flex items-center gap-3 pl-4 border-l border-outline-variant/20"><div class="text-right hidden sm:block"><p class="text-label-md font-label-md text-on-surface leading-tight">Operador Alpha</p><p class="text-[10px] uppercase text-primary tracking-widest">Admin Ventas</p></div><div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-primary flex items-center justify-center cursor-pointer hover:ring-2 ring-primary/30 transition-all"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-on-primary text-[18px]">person</span></div></div></div></header><main class="relative pt-16 min-h-screen bg-background"><div class="flex flex-col w-full relative min-h-screen pb-margin-desktop">
<div class="px-gutter pt-8 pb-12 flex flex-col gap-8 relative z-10">
<!-- Header Section -->
<div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-end justify-between gap-6">
